Fate was such a convenient word.%K%P
“命运”这个词有时候真是好用…%K%P
Yet a man's life would always be shaped by his own\nchoices, not the whims of some invisible guiding force.%K%P
人的一生，才不是由那种东西决定的。\n万事万物的结局都是自己选择后的必然。%K%P
