离东萩守车站只需１０分钟的步行。%K%P
A residential area almost completely isolated from the\nclamor of the city.%K%P
这是一条与车站的嘈杂渐行渐远，\n逐渐回归宁静的住宅街。%K%P
It was here, at the street address of East Hagimori 3-24,\nthat I found a house whose decrepit-looking entrance plate\nhad \dTerrace House Hinosaka\d inscribed on it.%K%P
在东荻守三丁目２４番地这块土地矗立着的建筑上，\n挂着『Terrace House阳之坂』这块破旧的名牌。%K%P
She told me she also worked as the landlord of this\napartment complex, but it didn't bring in enough money to\nsustain her on its own. Hence her other jobs.%K%P
据她所述，她是这栋公寓的房东，\n但是光靠公寓的租金来维生还是有些艰苦，\n所以才去做现在这份工作。%K%P
I recalled her cheerfully declaring that it was small and\nrun-down, but also a very important place to her.%K%P
她笑着说，那里虽然又旧又挤，\n但对自己而言是个珍贵的地方。%K%P
