距离那次命运的邂逅已经有三个月了…%K%P
Her voice rang with kindness and affection whenever she'd\nrepeat the invitation.%K%P
我每次去见她，她都会对我说这句话。\n而且，她温柔的目光里总是满含慈爱。%K%P
I wondered how she would react if someone like me, who'd\nonly seen her three times over the past three months, came\nbarging into her home.%K%P
但是，三个月以来仅仅见过三次面的我，\n像这样突然上门拜访，\n她究竟会作何感受呢。%K%P
