\dI-I'm sorry!!\d%K%P
「对、对不起…」%K%P
Really, though... What other conclusion could I come to,\ngiven an easy linear equation like that?%K%P
因为…\n你给出的是一道连三年级小学生都会算的加减法啊。%K%P
