%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-It's nothing of the sort! I've never even dared to\nimagine myself as a salesman!\d%K%P
「不、不是的。\n那种劝诱别人订报纸的厚颜无耻态度\n我打生下来就没有用过啊」%K%P
Besides, I had never heard of a business that would have\ntheir employees carry bouquets of roses on house calls.%K%P
而且拿花束作为附送礼品来签合同的\n风流推销店，我是闻所未闻。%K%P
