\dAnd...?\d%K%P
「然后呢？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dA-Actually, I've been seeing Hinosaka Honoka, the\nlandlord of this house, for about three months now,\nand...\d%K%P
「其、其实那个…\n这、这里的房东阳坂穗香小姐，\n我和她在三个月前就有往来（在交往）…」%K%P
%LCGirl
%LC女孩
\dYou've been seeing... Mom?\d%K%P
「和妈妈…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're her... daughter?\d%K%P
「你是她的…女儿吗？」%K%P
My mind couldn't keep up. Or rather, I had probably frozen\nit on purpose.%K%P
脑袋转不动了…\n不如说，一定是全身都在为阻止我脑袋转动而努力着。%K%P
I mean, I'd assumed she was a few years older than me,\nbut...%K%P
她肯定是要比我年长一些…我也有想到过…%K%P
Who would've thought she had a fully-grown... actually,\nthis girl was pretty small... But who could have guessed\nshe had a child this age?%K%P
这么大的…不，很矮小…不对…\n真没想到她有个这种年龄的孩子…%K%P
