%LC女孩
\dThree months? Three... months...?\d%K%P
「三个月之前…三个月之…前？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-There was something I had to tell her today, no matter\nwhat...\d%K%P
「今、今天有一些话，那个，\n 我无论如何都想要传达到…」%K%P
%LCGirl
%LC女孩
\d...!\d%K%P
「诶…！」%K%P
But...%K%P
但是…%K%P
I'd already passed the point of no return. I was dead\nserious about this.%K%P
剑已出鞘，\n不斩获点什么东西就收回的结局我才不要！%K%P
So what if she had a small, yet fully-grown daughter?%K%P
有个矮小却已经这么大了的女儿什么的，\n管它别人怎么想怎么说呢。%K%P
Something so trivial wouldn't get in the way of our\nfeelings.%K%P
这些在我们的感情面前，只是微不足道的小问题。%K%P
Not to mention, my courage would probably take leave of me\nunless I forced myself to think this way. I wasn't exactly\nthe strongest-willed individual around.%K%P
…毕竟，如果还是不能像这样投入自己感情的话，\n我的勇气绝对会在下一秒一下子全部跑光，\n我本来就是一个弱气的人啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-So, um, could you tell me if Ms. Honoka is--\d%K%P
「就、就是这样了，那个…穗香小姐她…」%K%P
