%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
Before I could ask whether or not the woman I'd been\nlooking for was home, I found myself interrupted by the\ngirl's now-emotionless voice.%K%P
『应该在家吧？』这半句还没说出来，\n就被少女那和刚才迥然相异的、死命压抑住感情的声音\n给堵在了喉咙里。%K%P
