%LC理
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「……诶？」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI loved her. I was serious.\d%K%P
「我喜欢她的啊…我是真心喜欢的啊」%K%P
%LCMuscular Man
%LC肌肉男
\dWell, I can't say I blame you. She's got a tendency to\ngive people the wrong impression.\d%K%P
「嘛，也不是不能理解你啦。\n那个人对谁都是一副风情半露的态度」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThere were some incidents she had with the tenants here.\nIt's never good news when she gets herself into these\nthings.\d%K%P
「她以前经常和这里的住户打得火热，\n每当那会儿…嘛，也是发生了各种各样的事啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... see.\d%K%P
「是…那样的吗」%K%P
To me, who knew nothing about her besides our\nrelationship, all the things the tenants said came as a\nshock.%K%P
我除了自己和她的那点事以外对她一无所知，\n所以从他们那得知的每一个事实对我来说都是冲击性的。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, the owner of the Terrace House Hinosaka is pretty\nmuch known as a jewel in a dunghill around these parts. I\nmyself had to get her out of trouble multiple times.\d%K%P
「嘛，说起Terrace House阳之坂的女神大人的话，\n在这附近好像是『柴屋西施』的代名词呢。\n我天天被这个那个拜托给牵线搭桥也受了不少累啊」%K%P
%LCMuscular Man
%LC肌肉男
\dYeah, right. If anything, you just brought on more\ntrouble.\d%K%P
「结果老爷子在这的隐居生活天天都不得安宁不说，\n最后还什么忙都没给人帮上」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat's right. These two guys solved nothing in the end,\nand it was the li'l landlord who ended up apologizing and\nevicting the guy. She even prepared the money for the\nmove.\d%K%P
「对对，基本上都是进退两难一筹莫展的状况，\n最后都是房东小妹向人家鞠躬赔礼，把人送走。\n连搬家费都特意给人家送去了哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Had that girl really been dealing with such adult problems\nsince then...?%K%P
那女孩从那时起就已经背负上了\n『普通孩子不可能去承受的辛苦』了啊…%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dBut I've never seen a more loving mother and daughter\nthan the owner and the Young Mistress. I wish I had a\ndependable daughter like that, goddammit...!\d%K%P
「就算是这样女神大人和小房东也是一对相亲相爱的母女啊。\n她这女儿还真是出落得佳人丽质啊，可恶」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see... But please, could you stop throwing out all\nthese confusing names for everyone?\d%K%P
「那先暂且不说…\n算我求你们了，请把称呼统一起来好吗」%K%P
Landlord. Owner. Young Mistress. Li'l landlord. Mr.\nRetired. Hattsuan. Young Master.%K%P
房东小姐啊女神大人啊小房东啊房东小妹啊\n老爷子啊小八啊小少爷啊，这些…？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dRight... so you were Kuma, then?!\d%K%P
「这样啊…您就是『熊先生』了吧！？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWhat? Where'd that come from?\d%K%P
「怎么了平白无故的来这么一句」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh, that was pretty shrewd of ya.\d%K%P
「哦，就冲着小少爷那智商，\n来上这么一句还真不容易啊」%K%P
The man doing squats as he sipped his apricot liqueur was\nallegedly the tenant of Room #3, Kumazaki Kisoku.%K%P
在我对面，从一开始就不停喝着清酒和做着蹲起运动的男子\n就是三号房的住户，名字好像叫做熊崎吉则来着…%K%P
I could see why Mr. Retired would like this place.%K%P
原来如此…老爷子的“隐居者”称号\n就是在『排房』居住而得名的啊。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dJust a few years ago, the guy was a systems engineer\nraking in over ten million yen per year, but then he\nsuddenly changed his vocation to an online fishing shut-\nin.\d%K%P
「小熊他啊，几年前还是个年薪千万以上的项目负责人来的，\n但是不知道是循了什么因果，现在成了家里蹲的ＮＥＴＡ工匠」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh? Are you running a sushi shop?\d%K%P
「那个…寿司店师傅？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, I guess you're better off not knowing. It's not\nsomething an average person should concern themselves\nwith.\d%K%P
「…不不，不懂的话就这样也挺好。\n嘛，也不是什么非得弄懂的内容啦」%K%P
And with that, he continued his squats.%K%P
他一边说着，一边持续做着蹲起。%K%P
He didn't seem like a shut-in, at least in terms of\nappearance. I might have been taller, but his muscular\nbuild made him way more intimidating.%K%P
不管怎么看也不像是家里蹲能拥有的那副身躯，\n能明显感觉到那副比我矮小的身体具有的压倒性的威慑力。%K%P
Actually, did it even make sense to exercise while\ndrinking booze?%K%P
不如说，人类在喝了酒之后还有可能做那么多运动吗…？%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAnd here you go, ron. Riichi... San an'kou toitoi... One\ndora... two dora... three dora... Ah, so close. Well, at\nleast I got a baiman.\d%K%P
「…就是这么回事了，胡。\n立直三暗刻对对胡宝牌１、２、３…啊～啊，我还自摸了。\n嘛，这是倍满了啊，庄家的」※译注：9番庄家自摸倍满8000X3。%K%P
