%LC理
\d...Sorry for intruding.\d%K%P
「………打、扰了」%K%P
It seemed the second impression I'd made on her was even\nworse than the first.%K%P
我这不连贯的话语，\n使她对我的印象跌倒极点了吧。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWelcome. Okay, when we finish this round, the li'l\nlandlord can be Player 2, yeah?\d%K%P
「欢迎光临～。\n那等这个半庄完了，第二名和房东小妹交换」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...What's all this about?\d%K%P
「…你们干什么呢这是？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
