「啊，这个呀，可是不容小觑的。\n买一张卡就能４个人一起联机对战！」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIt helps my old bones a lot to be able to play in any\nposition I like.\d%K%P
「我这种上了年纪的人啊，\n真庆幸还能像这样以各种姿势打牌」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYeah. You can even exercise while playing. It's the\nmahjong for a new, healthier age.\d%K%P
「没错，还能一边锻炼一边打。\n真可谓是健康时代的麻将啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFrom where I'm standing, though, you just look like a\nbunch of weirdos...\d%K%P
「不过从旁边看来真是相当诡异的情景啊…」%K%P
That was what I wanted to say.%K%P
这话我刚才也说过。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThen maybe you'd prefer some Mar** Ca** instead? That\none's great for parties.\d%K%P
