%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHahh... Count me out. I came because there's something I\nhave to tell you all.\d%K%P
「哈啊…算了。\n我只是有点事来跟大家说一下而已」%K%P
The girl -- Hinosaka Mitoko -- seemed to have decided to\ncompletely ignore my presence in the room.%K%P
她…阳坂美都子，从最初瞥了我一眼之后，\n好像是想一直彻底无视我的存在。%K%P
To be fair, I had only myself to blame.%K%P
嘛，不管怎么着，错确实是都在我这边就是了。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dTell us what?\d%K%P
「要说的是？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Uesaka, one month. Yasunaga, three months. Mr.\nKumazaki, six months. ...Wanna take a guess as to what I'm\ntalking about?\d%K%P
「上坂先生这月的，八须永君三个月的，\n熊崎先生半年的…好了，到底说的是什么来的？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「咳………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「啊………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm sorry, but I really can't wait any longer. Especially\ngiven the situation.\d%K%P
「不好意思啊，可我现在手头也很紧。\n各种各样的费用我这都得交着」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
With that, I finally understood what was going on.%K%P
就这一句话，就让我也完全明白她说的是什么事了。%K%P
Even if the age difference was all backwards, she was\nstill the landlord, and they were still her tenants.%K%P
因为，虽然给人的感觉像是年纪搞反了，\n但他们毕竟是房东和住户的关系。%K%P
...Not to mention, they didn't sound like the most\nupstanding tenants, either.%K%P
…不过他们倒真是欠了不少啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Uesaka, you usually pay on time, so I trust you,\nbut...\d%K%P
「上坂先生…\n您总是照日子付了钱，我还是相信您的，不过…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAh, my apologies, Young Mistress. I will make sure to\nhave it ready by tomorrow.\d%K%P
「啊啊、啊啊，小房东，您不用担心这事。\n明天一定恭恭敬敬给您把欠的补上。」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYasunaga? I won't accept tickets to your plays as\npayment, so don't try that again, got it?\d%K%P
「八须永君…像之前那样，\n用自己的剧团演出票来抵现什么的这次可不行了哦？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dA-Ahh! I'll make sure to have it ready by tomorrow.\nC'mon, have a bit more faith, li'l landlord!\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊！　明天一定会把我差的都补上。\n不要这样嘛，你要信我啊房东小妹～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow about you, Mr. Kumazaki? Anything to say?\d%K%P
「然后…熊崎先生你呢？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉則
\dTomorrow! I'll do something about it by tomorrow! I swear\nupon all that is holy!\d%K%P
「明天！我也是明天无论如何都会想办法交上的！\n神大人佛大人房东大人！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Seriously, do I have your word on this, you guys?\d%K%P
「…真的都没问题吗？各位」%K%P
%LCKihee & Yoshinori & Buntarou
%LC喜兵卫＆吉则＆文太郎
\dOf course!\d%K%P
「没问题！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm, now I feel like I got worked up over nothing. I\ndidn't expect you guys to actually pay up.\d%K%P
「感觉整个节奏都被你们搅乱了啊。\n绝对别想着要赖账呐」%K%P
Actually, I was quite surprised they even let someone get\naway with not paying rent for half a year. That must've\nbeen another manifestation of Ms. Honoka's kindness. ...Or\nmaybe this was simply that kind of place.%K%P
亏她还真让赖了半年房租的人住下去了啊。\n这也是受了善良的穗香小姐影响吧…或者说，\n是遗传了『那方面』吧。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYou ought to be more trusting of your tenants.\d%K%P
「不要这样吧，你得多给我这个原住户一点信任啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dThat's right. We've got to help each other out in times\nof need.\d%K%P
「是啊是啊，困难的时候就要互相帮助嘛」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWe all understand how tough it is for you now.\d%K%P
「我们都知道啦。\n现在咱们处在十分艰难的时期这件事」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Yeah, okay. Thank you, everybody.\d%K%P
「…嗯，我知道了。\n大家，谢谢你们」%K%P
I could tell this girl was -her- daughter -- she was\nsmiling so honestly at the mere promise of receiving\npayment from a bunch of people who had been late for\nmonths.%K%P
这些欠了一屁股租金的人只是简简单单地许下了付钱的诺言，\n这孩子就如同安心下来一样微笑着感谢对方，\n她果然是那个人的女儿啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnyway, sorry for bothering you. Feel free to continue\nyour game now.\d%K%P
「那么，不好意思打扰了。\n请你们继续吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
But not even the tiniest glimmer of that radiant smile was\ndirected at me.%K%P
可直到最后，\n她对住户们露出的笑颜，\n连其中的百分之一也没有向现在的我展露…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, that's right... Mr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
「啊，还有那啥…失业先生」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow long have you been standing behind that door?!\d%K%P
「你从什么时候开始就站在门口了！？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI prepared you a futon in Room #4. You can sleep over\nthere after you're done partying.\d%K%P
「四号房的被褥已经铺好了…\n你这边完事了以后就到那边去睡吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut you're gonna be leaving tomorrow, okay?\d%K%P
「不过也只是暂时让你住…啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Another unexpected attack...%K%P
又来这种突然袭击…%K%P
But this time, I felt no pain on my cheeks. Instead, I\nexperienced something much deeper and more agonizing\nspreading across my chest.%K%P
只不过这次的疼痛并不是来自脸颊\n抑或身体上的任何感官部位，而是内心被千针一点一点扎着，\n痛觉缓缓地侵袭大脑，一点一点地…%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHehe, didn't I tell you? You gotta look pretty hard to\nfind a more kind-hearted girl than her.\d%K%P
「嘿嘿，所以我不是说了吗？\n房东小妹她啊，其实是个很温柔的软妹子啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't remember you telling me that...\d%K%P
「这种事你一句都没提过啊…」%K%P
Once again, it came so out of nowhere I forgot to thank\nher.%K%P
没错，战前情报是一点都没有，\n而且…还忘记感谢她了。%K%P
I was such a magnificent failure of an adult.%K%P
我还真是个废柴大人的优秀代表啊。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, anyway, why don't we go for the home stretch?\d%K%P
「来吧，这是咱们的最后冲刺了！」%K%P
Mr. Retired spoke up in a cheerful voice to dispel the\ndepressing atmosphere dominating the room.%K%P
老爷子仿佛是想要将这沉闷的空气扫净一般，\n用格外开朗的语调说道。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dRight, I'm gonna turn things around, then!\d%K%P
「好～嘞，我可是要逆转了哦～！」%K%P
Yasunaga joined him.%K%P
八须永君紧跟着，也燃起了斗志。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYeah, that's right! Can't lose now! I mean, we're betting\nall we have on this!\d%K%P
「没错没错，气势啊气势！\n毕竟这是赌上了大价钱的真正决斗啊！」%K%P
And so did Kumaza... Wait, what?%K%P
然后熊崎先生他………什么？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dU-Um... Did you say something about betting?\d%K%P
「那、那个，刚才…\n你提到钱了吗？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAh. Did we forget to introduce you to our Hinosaka-style\nrules? Ten thousand points equals one month's worth of\nrent.\d%K%P
「啊啊，没跟你说阳之坂的规矩吗？\n每一万点就算一个月的租金…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou just made that up on the spot, didn't you?!\d%K%P
「那是你们刚刚决定的吧！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dGoodness, Laid-off. Don't you know you should always\nverify the rules before entering the joint?\d%K%P
「不要吧～失业小哥儿。\n在进不熟的店之前不好好确认一下店规怎么能行啊～」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dIt's not like we forced you to play.\d%K%P
「我们几个，又没强制你参加，是吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-You people...\d%K%P
「你、你们这些人…」%K%P
Oh, crap...%K%P
不行了…%K%P
I remembered hearing how collecting private debts could\nget even messier than business conducted by legitimate\ncollections agencies.%K%P
这帮欠债大爷弄钱的积极性\n已经比借黑钱的利息都要高了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I don't have that kind of money! I mean, you yourselves\nhave been making fun of me because I'm unemployed!!\d%K%P
「我、我可没有那么多的钱啊！\n说到底失业者就是没有工作的人啊，\n你们不是来来回回地都这么叫的吗！」%K%P
I could scream all I wanted, but would it work on them?%K%P
而且不管说些什么，\n我这边是一点先机都占不到…%K%P
And given my disastrous luck, I seriously doubted that I'd\nbe able to turn this around with my rudimentary knowledge\nof mahjong.%K%P
更何况，我对麻将也就懂个规则，\n想来要是再加上一直以来那充满艺术美感的霉运，\n现在再要逆转简直是天方夜谭。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dOh, there's really no point in hiding it from us now.\d%K%P
「藏起来是不行的哦～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What are you talking about?\d%K%P
「什…什么啊？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDidn't you just talk about what you had in your pocket?\d%K%P
「你刚才说过的吧？\n左边裤兜里面的东西」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh! But that's...\d%K%P
「啊！\n…但、但是，这个是…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIt's lost its purpose anyway, no? You should stay true to\nthe Edo spirit, and just use all you've got.\d%K%P
「你最开始的目标已经失去了吧？\n这里就吧唧～一巴掌给拍桌上才是真的江户男儿嘛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm from Gifu, though.\d%K%P
「我是岐阜人…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dGifu! Awesome! When Mino and Hida provinces come\ntogether!\d%K%P
「岐阜啊！真好啊！\n美浓的子女啊～飞弹的儿女啊～，把这黑夜都点亮吧～♪」\n※译注：此处一整句出自农口清志「どじょっこふなっこ」，儿歌。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dTime to show some cojones, Laid-off. You've got to save\nMitoko and the Terrace House Hinosaka... and us!\d%K%P
「现在是展现你的男人气概的时候啦。\n不光为了美都子妹妹和我们几个…\n更是为了Terrace House阳之坂啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dGive me a break here...\d%K%P
「饶了我吧…」%K%P
They even knew where I was keeping it. I truly had the\nworst luck.%K%P
竟然被他们发现了…\n果然是，时运不济啊。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dFixed property tax...?\d%K%P
「固定资产税…吗？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dYeah. The bane of all land owners, occuring once a year.\d%K%P
「没错没错，春天的故事。\n每年都会上演一次地主们的忧郁」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dB-But... Not to be rude, but this building doesn't seem\nlike an ideal candidate for high taxation.\d%K%P
「但、但是，虽说有点失礼，\n但是我觉得这块地方的资产价值应该没那么高才对啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dC'mon, Laid-off, are you kidding me? Of course it\ndoesn't. Look, this thing was built over thirty years ago.\nNo private toilets or showers. Just a bunch of cheap\nrooms. Do you think anyone would tax it that heavily?\d%K%P
「讨厌啦～失业小哥儿～。那还用说嘛。\n３０多年的老房子，厕所是公用的，没有浴室的平房，\n除了负面评定以外还能有个啥？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThen... what's the problem?\d%K%P
「那还为什…？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dDid you pay any attention to the surrounding scenery on\nyour way here?\d%K%P
「你啊，来这儿的路上，\n有好好注意周围的风景么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe scenery...? Not really. It was close to the station,\nbut surprisingly quiet. And there weren't many tall\nbuildings around. The road looked well-kempt. It looked\nlike a place you'd want to build luxury homes at... Ah.\d%K%P
「周围…不，也没特别注意。\n离车站挺近但是挺清净，也没建什么太高的大楼，\n道路也很干净，是个如画般的高级住宅街…啊」%K%P
Ten minutes on foot from East Hagimori Station.%K%P
离东萩守车站步行只要１０分钟。%K%P
A residential area almost completely isolated from the\nclamor of the city.%K%P
这是一条与车站的嘈杂渐行渐远，\n逐渐回归宁静的住宅街。%K%P
And all the other buildings I saw on the way were quite\nobviously of a different breed than this decrepit boarding\nhouse.%K%P
而且，在这清静的住宅街上矗立着的那些建筑物，\n不管是哪一栋，都让这座公寓越发站不住脚。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThe price of the land here keeps on rising, and that, of\ncourse, is reflected in the taxes.\d%K%P
「这附近的地价每年都在增长。\n所以也自然而然反映到税金上了」%K%P
The building itself certainly seemed like it was about to\nfall down, but being a one-story apartment complex, it\nactually covered quite a bit of ground.%K%P
虽说这房子的确破破烂烂，\n但毕竟也是大平房公寓，占的地倒是一点都不少。%K%P
In that sense, the Hinosaka household might have owned\nquite a fortune in land.%K%P
仔细想想，光这块土地就是很大一笔资产了吧…？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...How were they dealing with this until now?\d%K%P
「…至今为止，都是怎么撑过来的啊？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dC'mon, why d'you think the landlord... that is, the li'l\nlandlord's mom had to find another job?\d%K%P
「所以说房东小姐…房东妹妹的妈妈她\n才会必须去另找一份工作啊」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dIt seems to have caused more problems than it solved,\nthough.\d%K%P
「…可不知怎么的最后落了个本末倒置的结局啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see...\d%K%P
「原来如此…」%K%P
They had to fight the ever-rising property tax as well as\ntheir own living expenses. Just two women, all on their\nown.%K%P
除了她们母子二人的生活费用，\n还有一笔每年都在增长的巨额固定资产税要交。%K%P
There was no choice but for Ms. Honoka to look for another\njob, which led to many new encounters, and ultimately, the\ncurrent tragedy on our hands.%K%P
这样穗香小姐就必定要出来打工…\n但这个决断让她与那个人相遇，促成了新的悲剧。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAt her age, she should be spoiled by her mother. Don't\nyou have any pity in your heart? How much of a monster are\nyou, Young Master?!\d%K%P
「她这个年龄，本来应该还在向母亲撒娇的…啊啊喂？\n难道不觉得她很可怜吗？你是魔鬼吗，小少爷」%K%P
Although...%K%P
就算是这样…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you think this situation could have been avoided if\nyou people had paid your rent on time...?\d%K%P
「难道说该不会，要是你们每个月都有好好交租金的话，\n事情就不会发展到这个情况了…？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...I wonder if it's gonna rain tomorrow. I sure hope it\ndoesn't. It would only ruin the cherry blossoms.\d%K%P
「………明天是要下雨了吧？\n樱花飘落了，周围就素气了啊」\n※译注：出自阿佐田哲也的《麻将放浪记》。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dEh? You've got a hand? Now?\d%K%P
「诶？你要吃牌？在这个局面下？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWhat are you all blabbering about...?\d%K%P
「你这是在说些什么啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh.\d%K%P
「啊」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHm? Something wrong, Young Master?\d%K%P
「嗯？怎么了，小少爷？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI've got a Tsumo here. Thirteen-way wait for Kokushi-\nmusou.\d%K%P
「自摸了………国士无双十三面听」\n※译注：国士无双十三面，十三幺听十三张胡牌，\n记双倍役满，闲家自摸64000，庄家自摸96000。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow does this work under Hinosaka rules? A normal score\nor double?\d%K%P
「照阳坂的规矩，这个，是要怎么算的啊？\n只是普通的庄家役满？还是说是算双倍役满？」\n※译注：就算只算普通役满庄家自摸也有48000，铁定1位了。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Apparently, this is what you get when your luck hits rock\nbottom.%K%P
挥之不去的霉运发展到了极限，\n所谓否极泰来貌似就是这种情况吧。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
As I returned to Room #4 after the... I guess you'd call\nit a party... I did actually find a futon prepared for me.%K%P
我在联欢会（？）结束后回到四号房。\n她真的为我铺好了被褥。%K%P
That girl -- Hinosaka Mitoko -- really was too kind for\nher own good.%K%P
她…叫做阳坂美都子的姑娘，\n怎么说呢，我觉得她真的打心眼里是个好人啊。%K%P
I'd done nothing but upset her, and she still went out of\nher way to lend me her own futon.%K%P
即使我是个净惹她生气的人，\n但她还是专门把自己用的被褥拿来给我用。%K%P
And how did I know it was hers...?%K%P
不过…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAchoo!\d%K%P
「阿嚏！」%K%P
If I stretched my legs out, the damn thing was half a\nmeter too short for me.%K%P
一伸腿，膝盖以下就会漏到被子外面。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI overslept.\d%K%P
「睡过头了啊」%K%P
I only managed to fall asleep when it started to get\nbright outside. At first, I had trouble finding a position\nthat would allow the sheet to cover most of my body. And\nthen came all the negative thoughts creeping into my mind.%K%P
上床时已经是拂晓前，\n把身体团起来，迷迷糊糊地眯了一会儿，天就亮了。\n而且各种各样的事在我脑袋里打着转。%K%P
By the time I came to, the sun had already set.%K%P
之后等我恢复意识的时候，\n太阳已经西沉到现在这个角度了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPhwahh...\d%K%P
「呼啊啊啊啊～，啊～啊」%K%P
I advanced through the darkening street of East Hagimori,\nshaking my still-drowsy head.%K%P
我摇着依然昏昏沉沉的脑袋，\n走在黄昏的东萩守街头。%K%P
I wasn't really in any shape to leave the apartment -- or\nmore accurately, the boarding house -- today.%K%P
醒来的时候都已经到这个点了，\n今天想要离开那栋公寓…或者说排房是不可能的了。%K%P
I doubted the landlord would greet the news with a smile,\nand I felt genuinely guilty about causing her even more\ntrouble, but...%K%P
房东小姐大概又会向我露出难看的脸色了，\n感觉真是太对不起她了。%K%P
Being a walking nuisance was exactly what got me booted\noff the social ladder to begin with.%K%P
话虽这么说，可我还是要给人家添很多麻烦，\n正因为如此，我才会必然被社会淘汰啊。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn any case...\d%K%P
「不过…」%K%P
Now that I'd taken a closer look at the neighborhood, I\ncould understand what the residents of the Terrace House\nHinosaka were going on about yesterday.%K%P
冷静下来环视一下鳞次栉比的街边，\n我重新领悟到了昨天各位住户所说的种种意味。%K%P
The houses in this area seemed to take up more land than\nour Terrace House, which was already quite big in its own\nright.%K%P
这附近的每家每户，全都紧挨在一起，\n在比那么大的Terrace House阳之坂还要大的土地上，\n建着比那么大的Terrace House阳之坂更加庞大的建筑。%K%P
I could spot two or three expensive-looking cars in each\nof the garages, not to mention the security cameras on\npretty much every single wall.%K%P
车库里停放个几辆高档进口车貌似不是稀奇事，\n而且在车库和大门前，\n理所当然地设置了监控摄像头。%K%P
Managing a run-down boarding house in this area most\nlikely brought less profit than it would have as a parking\nlot.%K%P
走着走着，我就觉得那个廉价公寓的租金收入，\n都比不上把那块地当做收费停车场来使能赚到的零头。%K%P
Well, this wasn't really an area that people struggling\nwith taxes chose to live in.%K%P
不，说到底，\n这附近根本就不是给为了交税而拼命干活的人住的…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「咦？」%K%P
I spotted a red bicycle -- its seat almost uncannily low\n-- parked by the entrance to a park.%K%P
我在公园的入口处停下了脚步，\n发现了一辆车座很低的红色自行车。%K%P
I had a vague recollection of seeing it somewhere before.%K%P
我记得昨天我的余光好像扫到过那个…%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dZzz... zzz...\d%K%P
「呼…呼…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMhm... zzz...\d%K%P
「唔…呜…呼呼呼呼…」%K%P
There was a paperboy's bag in the basket, along with a few\nleftover newspapers.%K%P
自行车的货框里，有个报纸销售店的袋子。\n里面剩下的报纸只剩下了两三份。%K%P
She'd likely succumbed to exhaustion on her way back to\nthe shop, right after finishing her deliveries.%K%P
与蔓延到全身的疲惫斗争，骑着车子跑遍大街小巷，\n在送完所有报纸后的归途，伴随工作完成的安心感，\n暂时失去了坚持的力量，倦意一下子涌上来了…吗？%K%P
I had only known her for a day, but I was pretty sure my\nassessment was right on the mark.%K%P
虽然和她相遇只过去一天，\n但我相信自己的推测是没错的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dZzz... ngh... mhm...\d%K%P
「呼…唔，嗯～…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Still...%K%P
不过话说回来…%K%P
I already got that impression when I saw her face on our\nfirst meeting, but...%K%P
在第一次见到她的时候，\n我也曾在她脸颊靠近的那一瞬间想到过这事来着。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHahh... nhm...\d%K%P
「呼唔…嗯…」%K%P
Her eyes were a bit different, but the overall outline of\nher face -- her lips and nose in particular -- held\nunmistakable traces of...%K%P
虽然眉目有一点点不同，但是那小巧的脸颊轮廓，\n从嘴巴周围到鼻尖，脑海中她的整个模样…%K%P
...the woman I had fallen for.%K%P
与夺走我心的那个人的面庞相重合，\n让我不禁快要窒息。%K%P
In short, she'd likely give birth to an entire legion of\ntortured souls like myself once she grew up.%K%P
…嘛，也就是说，\n等这孩子长大了，也会和那个人一样，\n制造一大批像我这种被迷得找不着北的傻瓜吧。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNgh... Hm? Huh...?\d%K%P
「嗯…嗯？\n咦…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Before I knew it -- maybe because I'd blocked the sun\ncaressing her forehead -- she quivered and slowly opened\nher eyes.%K%P
我沉浸在橙色的痴迷中，时间过得好快。\n不觉间，我的身体与拉长的影子挡住了她脸上的夕阳。\n她停止不算太久的瑟瑟发抖，缓缓地睁开了双眼。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWelcome back.\d%K%P
「辛苦了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere you go, 120 yen.\d%K%P
「给，１２０日元」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, you don't have to do that.\d%K%P
「算了，又不贵」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSays Mr. Flat Broke.\d%K%P
「明明都穷成那样了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, fair enough... But I think I can cover that much\nmyself.\d%K%P
「这倒是，不过…１２０元我还是出得起的」%K%P
Any more and I probably would've been in trouble, though.%K%P
我也只能承受住这点花销了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm... Well, thanks. Don't mind if I do.\d%K%P
「嗯………那就多谢啦。\n我要喝了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBy the way...\d%K%P
「说起来…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Nah, it's nothing. I hope it's good.\d%K%P
「…不，没什么。\n我也喝了」%K%P
I found myself recalling how canned coffee had brought me\nand Ms. Honoka together as well.%K%P
第一次遇到穗香小姐的时候，\n好像也是一罐咖啡来着。%K%P
It felt like a far-off memory by now, but it had only\nhappened three months ago, if I recalled correctly.%K%P
现在想想简直虚幻得恍如隔世，\n但其实也就是将回忆与梦倒退至\n三个月前的那个飘雪冬夜里吧。%K%P
At the time, it had been a small can of black coffee.%K%P
那个时候，是一小罐无糖黑咖啡。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNgh... phew.\d%K%P
「嗯咕………呼」%K%P
But now, it was a larger can of milk coffee.%K%P
但现在喝的，是大罐的牛奶咖啡。%K%P
On that winter night, the heat and bitterness went\nstraight to my heart. But this time, the warmth and\nsweetness permeated my very bones.%K%P
我一直记得那时寒风包裹下心中的滚烫与苦涩共存，\n而现在的感觉呢，身体沐浴在暖春的夕阳里，\n沁透着淡淡的寂静，幽幽的香甜，还有她的容颜。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm...\d%K%P
「我说啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI've got permission from the school, okay?\d%K%P
「我有得到学校许可的」%K%P
This girl was awfully shrewd...%K%P
真是个敏感的孩子啊…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHave you been doing this since spring break?\d%K%P
「是从春假开始的？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNah, I've been doing this one for way longer than that.\d%K%P
「唔嗯唔，这边的话很早以前就在干了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThis one...?\d%K%P
「这边，就是说？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI started working for the lunch box delivery place last\nweek. Mom used to work there, too.\d%K%P
「我上周在车站前的便当店也找了个活。\n妈妈以前在那家店里干过」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
