%LC文太郎
\dThe pleasant mood and excitement dissipated as if it had\nnever been there at all. And so, the fate of the world\nrested in the right hand of a lone man...\d%K%P
「先前的疯狂好似从未发生过一般，会场又回归了寂静…\n然后，整个世界的命运，现在都寄托在这个男人的右手当中…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dCan you hurry it up already?\d%K%P
「快给我投啊」%K%P
It had only been a few days, and these guys were the very\ndefinition of swindlers, yet I couldn't help but feel\nsomewhat morose over parting with them -- likely for good.%K%P
即使是和这样一群只相处了几天，而且稍微一不留神\n就不知道要被他们榨取多少钱财的人分别，\n我还是感到些许的寂寞。%K%P
I'd simply gotten that used to living here over the past\nfew days.%K%P
我甚至都感觉自己已经熟悉了这栋『自称』Terrace House的公寓。%K%P
But...%K%P
但是…%K%P
\dYou're nothing to me, Mr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
『因为，失业先生你，根本就是与此无关的人啊』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dThree wins and one loss. Pretty good, if I do say so\nmyself. Anyway, your round is up next, Mr. Retired and\nLaid-off.\d%K%P
「这样就是三胜一负…了。\n那么下一场比赛，老爷子对失业男」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh... I was thinking I should be leaving soon.\d%K%P
「啊…我差不多也该休息了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dSurely you jest, Young Master. The moon is still young in\nthe sky.\d%K%P
「什么啊小少爷，开这种玩笑可不行。\n天这才刚刚黑不是吗」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I was planning to get up and leave early tomorrow.\d%K%P
「不了，我还想着明天要早点出门呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYou should relax and spend a few more days with us... Or\na year.\d%K%P
「多住一段时间也没什么问题嘛。\n过上个一年左右」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYeah, that's right. You've already lived here for five\ndays without paying. No one's gonna complain if you just\nup and don't leave.\d%K%P
「没错没错，都已经住在这五天不付房钱了。\n死皮赖脸地多住一段时间谁都不会有什么怨言的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI have a feeling the landlord would beat me to death,\nactually.\d%K%P
「那样肯定是要被房东小姐踹出去的吧」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dNah, it's gonna be fine. I dunno why, but the Young\nMistress seems to have taken a liking to you. I'm sure\nshe'll let you stay, maybe after slapping you around a few\ntimes at worst.\d%K%P
「什么啊没事的。\n虽然不知道为什么，不过感觉小房东还是挺中意你的。\n估计只会把你揍一顿，然后就随你怎样了吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI feel my dignity as a member of society would be in\nserious peril, though...\d%K%P
「那个，就算是我也是有着作为社会人士的矜持的…」%K%P
Besides, she wasn't treating me like this due to personal\nfeelings, but simply because she was the kind of person to\nhelp others in need.%K%P
说到底，她温柔对待我，也绝对不是因为中意我，\n而是无法对陷入困境的人弃之不顾，仅此而已。\n她就是这样的人。%K%P
And it made me depressed to get slapped by a girl half my\nage.%K%P
最主要的是，被一个比自己年纪小那么多的女孩子\n痛打这么多次，想想就觉得悲伤。%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI see... It's gonna get lonely here without you.\d%K%P
「是嘛…要冷清起来了啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI had a great time. Thank you.\d%K%P
「这些天给你们添麻烦了，感谢不尽」%K%P
I had the feeling they'd keep having fun regardless of\nwhether I was around or not, but articulating that would\nbe uncouth in this situation, as Mr. Retired would put it.%K%P
虽然我觉得就算我不在这几个人依然会过得风生水起，\n但是这么说了的话就真成老爷子所厌烦的『不解风情』了。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dSo, what's your plan from here on out?\d%K%P
「你以后打算怎么办？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was thinking of returning to my parents' home for a\nwhile to reconsider my options.\d%K%P
「先回一趟老家，好好想想之后该如何安身立命」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI bet three months that he becomes a total shut-in.\d%K%P
「我赌『就那样再也不出家门』三个月的份」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYou're on. I'm betting six months.\d%K%P
「好啊来赌啊。\n我赌『之后家里蹲一辈子』半年的份」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHey now, that's not much of a bet, you know. There's no\nhelping you kids. Fine, I'll take this upon myself. I'm\nbetting a year's worth of rent that he'll never make a\nreturn to society.\d%K%P
「喂喂，那样的话不是没法赌了吗。没法子啊。\n好吧，我也是条汉子，就全部由我来承受吧。\n我赌『没有回归社会的迹象』一年的份！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I would advise you to start paying your rent properly,\ngentlemen. As a wise man once said, one day you might find\nyourselves on the streets.\d%K%P
「………各位啊，也要好好交上各自的房租哦？\n你们自己住的地方没准马上就要消失了哦？」%K%P
During these five days, I'd honed my wit to be able to\nreturn a jab or two.%K%P
在这五天里，我也渐渐锻炼出了回嘴的能力，\n精神层面上似乎受到了很好的磨练。%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dIt's all right. I'm not in debt, anyway. And my pension\nis coming up next week.\d%K%P
「没问题的。我只是本来没有多少积蓄而已。\n下个礼拜就该收到今年的养老金了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dGuess I'll try showing my face at the university once in\na while. Plenty of \dfriends\d I haven't borrowed money from\njust yet.\d%K%P
「我也是偶尔到大学里露个脸的。\n还有好多好多没有借过钱的“挚友”呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dMe too. I just sneaked an affiliate link onto one of the\ntop sites yesterday.\d%K%P
「我也是，昨天开始在电商网站首页上，\n随便发布了几个共同营销企划」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm? Is that so? I guess that's good, then.\d%K%P
「唔？是这样吗，那就好」%K%P
I had no idea what he was talking about, but at least it\nseemed like he cared and was doing something for this\nboarding house.%K%P
虽然我更想回应说“这是哪门子的没问题”，\n不过他们似乎也在用他们的方式关怀这栋公寓。%K%P
And so, relieved by their words, I could finally leave\nthis place without looking back.%K%P
所以我也可以稍稍安心那么一点，\n起身，直接离开这里，不用回头…%K%P
...Yeah, right. If I could actually do it that easily, I'd\nhave found a new job and a life by now.%K%P
…如果我能做到，而且生性乐观的话，\n应该早就找到新的工作，过上正常的生活了吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm...\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
In the end, I found myself dallying in front of the\nlandlord's room.%K%P
就是因为这样，我在房东小姐的房间门口，\n来来回回绕着圈子。%K%P
The tenants invited her to my farewell party as well, but\nshe refused, saying she had to get up early tomorrow.%K%P
虽然各位住户都邀请了她来参加送别会，\n但都被她以明天要早起为由拒绝了。%K%P
Still, no one in their right mind could blame her for\nbeing cold and distant.%K%P
但是，谁也没有觉得她不讲道理或者薄情。%K%P
We all knew she woke up at 3AM every morning to deliver\nnewspapers.%K%P
因为那个小姑娘凌晨三点就要起床，然后到处去派送报纸，\n这里的每一个住户都很清楚这件事。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHm... Hmm...\d%K%P
「那个…那个…」%K%P
And that wasn't all. Last week, she apparently started\nworking for a lunch box delivery service. And yesterday, I\neven ran into her working the register at the convenience\nstore.%K%P
不光是那样…\n从上周开始还加上了便当店的工作，\n而且昨天又在便利店的收银台遇见了她。%K%P
After giving me an indignant glare, she pushed the buttons\non the register faster than any new employee would, going\nso far as to put a can of coffee and some gum into my bag,\nclaiming they were on the house.%K%P
她用着惊人的气势瞪着我，\n用着最初那天根本想象不到的熟练手法操作着收银机，\n最后把我买的咖啡和口香糖之类的东西流畅地放到了袋子里。%K%P
As someone who had trouble scraping together enough money\nto eat, I would've preferred some chocolate instead, but I\nknew I'd probably get slapped in the face again if I said\nthat.%K%P
虽说在饥肠辘辘的时候会很感激垫肚子的巧克力，\n但要是跟她这么说的话恐怕又要挨一巴掌了。\n这一点我已经领会到了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...What should I do?\d%K%P
「…怎么办啊」%K%P
What would become of her, working from the early morning\nhours until late at night? She definitely didn't seem like\nthe type to have much stamina.%K%P
每天，从早上到晚上，不对，是从凌晨到晚上，\n不管怎么看都不可能有多余的体力的她，\n一刻也不休息就这样一直干下去会成什么样…%K%P
With all that in mind, knocking on her door around\nmidnight felt like a genuinely vile thing to do.%K%P
在胡思乱想的过程里，不知不觉日期就要变更了，\n在这种时间敲响这扇门，似乎是种很恶劣的行为。%K%P
And even if I did, the possibility of her noticing was\nlikely nonexistent.%K%P
而且大概，不管我敲得多响，\n被她注意到的可能性，似乎都低得可怜。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm really out of my mind. ...Maybe it'd be better if I\njust left her alone.\d%K%P
「果然是我太没常识了啊。\n…放弃吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNotice me already, you dolt!\d%K%P
「你也差不多该注意到了吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhoa?!\d%K%P
「哇噢噢噢噢…唔？」%K%P
I managed to suppress my scream midway, realizing it was\nthe middle of the night.%K%P
我一下子大叫了出来，但突然想起这是大半夜，\n会吵着别人，所以立即压低声音收了尾。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou really are naturally predisposed to being rude,\naren't you? Don't let it go to your head just because\nyou're a bit taller than everyone else.\d%K%P
「你还是那样用一副理所当然的样子干些没礼貌的事啊。\n不就是个子高了点嘛，还得意忘形了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry... I truly am. B-But I wasn't letting it go\nto my head or anything. And I think my parents' genes are\nmostly to blame for my height.\d%K%P
「抱、抱歉，对不起了…\n但、但是我没有得意忘形啊。\n而且我的个子这么高也是家长的遗传…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh? Now you're making fun of my mom, too?\d%K%P
「什么啊，你是说这是妈妈的错吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? ............Ahh!! I'm sure it's an acquired trait.\nI'm to blame for everything.\d%K%P
「诶？………………啊啊！\n不、不是，那样的事我没…是后天长高的，是我的错，嗯」%K%P
And Ms. Honoka wasn't that short, at least as far as I\nremembered.%K%P
穗香小姐她，的确没有这么矮小。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
Was I naturally predisposed to being rude, after all?%K%P
果然我从本质上来讲就是个很没礼貌的人吧？%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSo what do you want?  I'm sleepy, you know, so could you\nget this over with already?\d%K%P
「那你有什么事啊？\n我也是很困的，赶紧说完了事」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... I... I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「抱、抱、抱歉…」%K%P
Her voice rang clear and characteristically impatient as\never, though.%K%P
虽然嘴上说自己困了，\n但她那催促我的口吻还是一如往常。%K%P
...Had she really been sleeping?%K%P
…她真的是在睡觉吗？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... I was planning to leave tomorrow.\d%K%P
「那个…我想着明天就离开这里」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, I know.\d%K%P
「嗯，听说了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... I am truly grateful for everything you did for me\nthese past five days. And I'm sorry for causing you so\nmuch trouble. Including, err, all my possibly rude\nbehavior.\d%K%P
「那个…这段时间受你照顾了…不如说，\n给你添了很多麻烦…不如说，\n真是做了很多无礼的事情…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou can say that again.\d%K%P
「确实啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「………对不起了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, I'm just kidding. Actually, I'm sorry for lashing\nout at you all the time. ...I dunno why, but it kinda irks\nme when I look at you, Mr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
「开玩笑了啦。\n我才是，说了一堆很过分的话真是抱歉。\n…不知为什么一见到失业先生，我就会变得情绪暴躁起来」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm truly, genuinely sorry.\d%K%P
「………………………实在是我不对」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha, so we're on the same level as far as rudeness is\nconcerned. ...Anyway, good luck. Be sure to find a job,\nokay?\d%K%P
「啊哈哈，咱们双方都很没礼貌，\n这么想就相互抵消了吧。\n…那你保重啊。要打起精神找份工作哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Okay...\d%K%P
「好、好的…」%K%P
Even ignoring the difference in our age and height, the\nonly thing I could do was bow my head in shame.%K%P
年龄的差距身高的差距什么的，\n早就不是这些表面上的问题了，\n我除了深深地低下头以外别无选择。%K%P
I mean, she -- of all people -- knew what it meant to work\nhard.%K%P
因为，“工作”这个词语，\n只要从她嘴里说出来就有着无比的说服力…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI won't be able to see you off... but do your best out\nthere, okay?\d%K%P
「虽然是不能送你走了…但你要加油啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI will...\d%K%P
「明白…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「呜………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「嗯………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWas that all?\d%K%P
「已经、结束了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm...\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIf so, then good ni--\d%K%P
「那，晚安…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe new term at school begins tomorrow, doesn't it?\d%K%P
「明天开始就是新学期了吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...? Ah, yeah. What about it?\d%K%P
「诶…？\n啊，嗯，倒是那么回事，那又怎么了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh... Um...\d%K%P
「啊，那个，那啥…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「嗯………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCongratulations on advancing a year.\d%K%P
「恭喜你进入了新学级」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThanks.\d%K%P
「谢谢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou'll be doing entrance exams soon.\d%K%P
「这下终于成了应考生啊」%K%P
She'll be a third year come tomorrow.%K%P
从明天开始她就是三年级学生了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...It's not like everyone needs to take those exams.\d%K%P
「…也不是所有的三年级学生都会去考试的啦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're not planning to continue with your education?\d%K%P
「你不升学了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't know.\d%K%P
「这谁知道呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...What?\d%K%P
「…怎么了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you planning on keeping up this crazy work schedule\nafter school starts?\d%K%P
「都要开始上学了，\n你还要继续如此乱来的打工生活吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's not crazy.\d%K%P
「我那可不是乱来」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo you are...\d%K%P
「还要继续啊…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI mean, I can do it.\d%K%P
「因为，那可不是乱来…」%K%P
It was crazy.%K%P
就是在乱来…%K%P
Actually, it was physically impossible to even attend\nschool with that kind of schedule.%K%P
不如说，找了这么多份工，\n怎么可能安心好好学习啊…%K%P
Even if she somehow managed to squeeze in enough time to\nattend classes, what would she do about homework,\npreparation, and reviewing the subjects?%K%P
就算能够保证出勤的时间，\n预习复习就不用说了，连做作业的时间都剩不下。%K%P
Not to mention, I doubted she'd have enough stamina to\nkeep paying attention in class after all that work.%K%P
说到底，她有没有体力去听课都是个问题。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI doubt the school will permit that many jobs.\d%K%P
「那么多的兼职，你觉得学校那边会给你下发许可吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I'll do something about it.\d%K%P
「…怎么着也会、弄过去的 」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo what? Break the rules?\d%K%P
「怎么着…具体是要做什么？\n违反校规？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「唔…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnd then you'll keep being late, leaving early, or not\nattending at all. Your teachers and friends will start\nsuspecting something, you know.\d%K%P
「然后就是，不断迟到、早退、缺勤？\n那肯定会让老师和朋友们担心的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...!\d%K%P
「诶…！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOr will you stop going to school altogether? Even though\nit's your job to attend, just like it's mine to find\nproper work?\d%K%P
「还是说，干脆就不去上学了？\n就像我，不去找工作就会被你这样的人鄙视，\n那身为学生的你如果不去学习的话又成何体统呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Shut up, okay?\d%K%P
「…吵死了」%K%P
I made sure to pick the kind of phrasing that someone as\ndiligent as her would hate the most.%K%P
在我接二连三的问题轰炸之下，\n这已经是认真耿直的她所能选择的，\n最厌恶的态度了吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think I was that loud. I know it's the middle of\nthe night.\d%K%P
「我没出那么大声吧？\n再怎么说现在也是深夜了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI didn't mean it that way!!\d%K%P
「不是那个意思！」%K%P
If my indecisive nature irked her, then I could use it to\nget her angry, at least.%K%P
如果她对我举棋不定的态度感到烦躁不安的话，\n这个时候，我就应该变本加厉，把她惹怒到极致。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI know that much, okay? I was already well aware of\neverything you said. You don't need to tell me, okay?\d%K%P
「那些事，我都懂。\n就算你完全不说我也都明白的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're aware of it, but you can't do anything about it.\nYou're doing your best, but it's not enough.\d%K%P
「虽然明白，但就是怎么着都对付不过去吧？\n虽然很努力了，但还是得不到应有的回报吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShut up!!\d%K%P
「烦死啦！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You're bothering the neighbors. It's the middle of the\nnight, you know?\d%K%P
「…会吵到邻居哦？\n再怎么说现在也是深夜了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGrrr!!\d%K%P
「～唔！」%K%P
And as the final blow, I would trip her up.%K%P
我像个刻意挑刺的不良一样，进一步给她沉重打击。%K%P
I would bring this overly precocious girl to a level\nbefitting her age.%K%P
只是为了把一副大人样的这个小女孩，\n拖入小孩子似的拌嘴里。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...What am I supposed to do? I'm already doing everything\nI can!\d%K%P
「…不是没办法嘛。\n这不是什么办法都没有嘛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOf course there's nothing you can do. I mean, you're\nstill a child. You need an adult to look after you.\d%K%P
「是啊，没办法啊。因为你啊，\n本来应该是学生，是被监护人，是受抚养者啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhy the hell do you keep picking on me?! No wonder Mom\nturned you down...\d%K%P
「干嘛要说这么坏心眼的话啊。\n明明自己都被妈妈给甩了…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... don't believe she turned me down.\d%K%P
「我啊…根本不相信自己被她甩了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「…诶？」%K%P
All right, everything was going according to plan.%K%P
嗯，看来她已经中了我的圈套了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYour mother saved me.\d%K%P
「我啊，明明是被她拯救了啊」%K%P
Now I just had to use that little weakness she showed\nme...%K%P
之后，就等着露出破绽的她踏入陷阱不能自拔了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe offered me warm coffee and a warm heart when I was\ncontemplating suicide at the lowest point in my life.\d%K%P
「在我行将失去生的勇气，\n准备迎接死神召唤之时，\n她给了堕落的我烫手的咖啡和炙热的心灵」%K%P
I mixed truth with falsehood. Even I didn't know how\naccurate and trustworthy my words were.%K%P
真正的感情混合上诱骗的口气，\n用这些连我自己都不知道会相信多少的言语来决出胜负。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dShe might not be here at the moment, but I still love\nher. I can't just give up like that.\d%K%P
「就算现在已经不在这个地方了，\n她对我而言也是无比重要的人。\n我还没有放弃」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Laid-off...?\d%K%P
「失业先生…」%K%P
I wasn't doing my best, and as such, a life of hardship\nbefit me.%K%P
没有努力的我，\n被迫过上如此不自由的生活也是在所难免。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo, Ms. Landlord... or rather, Mitoko. It pains me to see\nMs. Honoka's kin -- her own daughter -- suffer.\d%K%P
「所以说房东小姐…不对，美都子。\n你作为穗香小姐的女儿却落到如此艰辛的境地，\n对我而言也是一件很悲伤的事情」%K%P
But I couldn't let this girl -- who had been pushing\nherself to the utmost limit -- be robbed of a life\nbefitting her age.%K%P
只是，我不想让奋不顾身努力着的这个孩子\n一言不发地放弃和她年龄、身份相符的生活。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm unemployed, I have odd eating habits, and I carry a\nwhole heap of misfortune on my back. Above all, I've had\nnothing to do with your life up until recently, but...\d%K%P
「我的确是个无业游民，还挑食，而且简直就是霉运的结晶，\n更重要的是，我与你至今为止的人生没有一点交集」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo matter how untrustworthy and pathetic I am, in the\neyes of society, I'm still an adult that receives all the\nleeway someone your age would not.\d%K%P
「但是我，不管有多么靠不住，多么没出息，\n至少在接触社会这方面，\n比起你来我也是有着各种各样作为『大人』的灵通的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo an adult like myself... might actually be able to help\nyou in some way.\d%K%P
「所以，作为大人的我…\n也许，能稍微为你做些什么…吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Mitoko. How about... How about you try trusting me,\nif only for a little bit?\d%K%P
「我说啊，美都子，就一点点就好。\n就当是死马当活马医也罢。\n…你能稍微期待我一下吗？」%K%P
After bringing her to a child's level, it was time for me\nto display my maturity.%K%P
一旦变成了小孩子的拌嘴，\n就能很容易地马上转入大人的领域。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you think we could be... friends?\d%K%P
「我们…不能成为朋友吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFriends...?\d%K%P
「朋友…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou can hit me as much as you want. I mean, friends do\nget angry at each other.\d%K%P
「就算你再怎么想要揍我也无所谓。\n因为只有成为了朋友才会互相置气的啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut then sometimes we could also laugh, make fun of, and\nrely on each other.\d%K%P
「但是偶尔也应该，或是一同欢笑，或是相互依靠，\n…或是互相开开玩笑吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
She -- Hinosaka Mitoko -- finally looked straight into my\neyes.%K%P
她…阳坂美都子的双眸，\n终于正面扬起，与我直直相对。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
And so I looked back into hers, glistening ever so\nslightly in the dark.%K%P
所以我，也一动不动地低着头…凝视着\n在迷蒙昏暗中泛起微微光芒的，她的双眼。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Eventually, her look relaxed and she parted her lips.%K%P
那率直的目光，一下子荡起了柔软的波纹。\n绷紧的嘴角慢慢地缓和下来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Laid-off.\d%K%P
「失业先生」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
After a moment of hesitation -- a fraction of a second,\nreally...%K%P
那个表情，其实只持续了不到一秒，\n不过也确确实实地在她脸上浮现着，不到一秒。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGood night.\d%K%P
「晚安」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Once again, she had refused to take my hand.%K%P
她又一次，\n没有握住，我伸出的手。%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
