%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAll right.\d%K%P
「好…嘞」%K%P
It was almost eight in the morning by the time I finished\ncleaning the futon, changing my clothes, and packing all\nmy things.%K%P
收拾好被褥，换好衣服，\n归置好行李之后，差不多已经是上午八点了。%K%P
In the week I spent here, I had already learned that no\none would be awake at this hour.%K%P
毕竟这个星期一直住在这里，\n我比谁都清楚这种时候是没有谁会起床的。%K%P
All the tenants would usually wake up sometime after noon.%K%P
各位住户起床之时，\n一般都是艳阳直直射入正南窗户的午间了。%K%P
Meanwhile, the most hardworking person in the neighborhood\n-- our landlord -- would be busy delivering lunch boxes\nafter her newspaper delivery shift.%K%P
而这附近最勤奋的房东小姐，\n如果是平时的话，应该是刚送完报纸，正在便当店打工。%K%P
But today...%K%P
但从今天开始是…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe first day of school.\d%K%P
「开学典礼啊」%K%P
The day on which she would return to being just Mitoko,\nnot a landlord.%K%P
本来这应该是『房东小姐』回归『美都子』，\n为之前劳作生活画上休止符的一天。%K%P
I wondered if she went to school today. Did she pull that\nuniform out from the corner of her wardrobe...?%K%P
她应该好好去上学了吧？\n前几天才深藏在柜子里的校服，她应该再次穿在身上了吧？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Either way, it wasn't my place to worry about it. After\nall, I had failed to convince her.%K%P
算了，担心也无济于事。\n因为直到最后我都没有能够说服那女孩。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
My door hit something as I tried to leave.%K%P
一打开四号房间的门，就有什么东西打在了门上，发出小小的声音。%K%P
It turned out to be a small bag, with a note attached.%K%P
…在门的前方，放着一个小小的纸袋。\n还有一张小便签贴在上面。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThis is...\d%K%P
「这个…」%K%P
As I'd already said, no one at the boarding house would be\nawake at this hour.%K%P
再重复说明一遍吧，\n这里根本没有会在这个时间段起床的人。%K%P
However, there was one person who would've already begun\ntheir day by this time.%K%P
不过在这个时间段之前就开始活动的人是有的。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs. Landlord...\d%K%P
「房东、小姐」%K%P
\dIt's for the train ride. You -can- eat sandwiches,\nright?\d%K%P
『请在坐电车的时候吃。\n这回是三明治，你能吃吧？』%K%P
Her handwriting was refined and uncompromising, just like\nher.%K%P
虽然很潦草，但真的是与她相符的，\n认真而又直接了当的笔迹。%K%P
And...%K%P
还有…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
\dP.S. I appreciate what you were trying to do last night.\nSo thanks.\d%K%P
『另起　这些天我还算很开心哦，谢谢你』%K%P
A strange feeling compelled me to check the other side of\nthe letter, only to find a couple of very small words at\nthe corner of the page.%K%P
伴随着那一点点的预感，把便签翻了过来，\n那里写了一排小小的，真的是小小的字，\n紧紧地挤在一起，在角落里排列着。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry.\d%K%P
「…抱歉」%K%P
In the end, I had always been on the receiving end. I\ncouldn't return the favor in any way.%K%P
到头来，我依然只是在获取恩惠，\n却不能回报她任何东西，\n包括她确实需要的，还有我擅自期望的…%K%P
She never expected anything from me, and so it didn't work\nout.%K%P
她对我，没有寄托任何的期待。\n所以，我可以用“竹篮打水一场空”来形容自己么？%K%P
I'd only spent a week in this house, but my failure to\nbuild any sort of trust still hit me hard.%K%P
只有短短的一个星期时间也许是不能强求什么，\n但我们之间果然连一点信赖关系都没有建立起来。\n这个本来就该料到的事实让我真的倍感失落…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank you... for everything.\d%K%P
「各个方面…都受您照顾了」%K%P
I said my final farewells and bowed my head to the place\nI'd grown used to seeing every morning over the past few\ndays.%K%P
我向这一个星期以来，紧紧烙印在我脑海中的景色\n深深鞠了一躬，宣告了我的离别。%K%P
I'm sorry for being unable to help you. I'm really sorry\nfor failing to become a more trustworthy adult.%K%P
抱歉，我无法帮上你的忙，\n无法扮演一个值得依靠的大叔，真的是抱歉了。%K%P
.........%K%P
………%K%P
......%K%P
……%K%P
...%K%P
…%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHm? Welcome home.\d%K%P
「啊呀，欢迎回来～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm back. You're early today. Are you going to practice?\d%K%P
「我回来了。\n今天起得挺早啊。这是要开始练习了吗？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dNah, I thought I'd drop by the uni once in a while. How\nabout you? Back already?\d%K%P
「没啦，我是要去一趟久违的大学。\n房东小妹你才是，这么早就回来了？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah. I mean, we only had the opening ceremony today.\d%K%P
「因为今天就只有开学典礼嘛」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAh, I see... So you did go to school all proper-like,\nthen.\d%K%P
「啊啊，是这样啊…你有好好去上学啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm a student, after all.\d%K%P
「毕竟我是学生啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYou sure it's not because Laid-off told ya to go?\d%K%P
「因为被失业的吐槽（教育）啦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAbsolutely sure.\d%K%P
「怎么会」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHe left, you know.\d%K%P
「他已经走了哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah.\d%K%P
「是啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI thought I could squeeze more cash out of him, but he\nturned out to be surprisingly good at looking out for\nhimself when things got real.\d%K%P
「本来还想着让他当当冤大头呢，\n没想到他在一些关键的地方还挺顽强的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Yeah.\d%K%P
「…是啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAnd he wouldn't ever shut up about us paying rent. I bet\nhe really pissed you off when he started griping about\nyour jobs.\d%K%P
「而且还天天要我们交房租交房租的，啰嗦死了。\n他可是侵犯了房东小妹你的职权啊，很烦人吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYeah, with that taken care of, I guess I should start\ngetting more serious about one of my jobs. So... when\nshould I expect that rent money to come in, hm?\d%K%P
「是啊，现在碍事的人也没了，\n我也久违地履行一回职责吧。\n那你是要什么时候交租金…呢…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
%XS10\dEh? What? I can't hear ya when you're all the way over there!\d %XE%K%P
「诶～什么～？离得这么远，我听不清楚啊～！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\d...Try not to get hit by a car, at least.\d %XE%K%P
「…小心别被车给撞了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAh, right! I almost forgot you could get cash from\ninsurance!\d%K%P
「啊啊，那是当了个然的啊。\n我就先走一步～啦！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Hahh.\d%K%P
「………哈啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWell, Laid-off. Looks like she's not too heartbroken over\nyou leaving. ...Guess you just have tough luck.\d%K%P
「喂失业的，她对你好像没怎么觉得惋惜啊。\n…到头来还是没啥报偿哦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
