%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHm? Ah, I'm sorry for being late. There was some\nunexpected expenditure I had to deal with last month.\d%K%P
「嗯？啊啊，拖了这么久真的是抱歉。\n上个月要用钱的地方稍微有点多」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDon't worry, it's fine... At least you've never been more\nthan a month late.\d%K%P
「唔唔嗯。只是这点程度，完全没问题的。\n而且老爷子您本来也没拖过超过两个月的嘛」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dHear that, Kuma?\d%K%P
「…听到了吗，熊先生？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dNo. I didn't hear a thing.\d%K%P
「没啊，完全没」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...Then why go out of your way to open the window and\nreply?\d%K%P
