Bacon. Lettuce. Tomato. Tuna. Eggs. And more things I\ncouldn't name. They even had cheese and were seasoned with\npizza sauce. That sure worked up a man's appetite.%K%P
培根、生菜、西红柿、金枪鱼、鸡蛋，还有很多别的东西。\n在披萨酱的基础上还放上了奶酪，这大大的刺激着我的食欲。%K%P
Then there was another bag with a variety of little\nsnacks.%K%P
在便当盒的另一层，各种菜肴紧紧地塞在里面。%K%P
Spinach and egg salad. Wieners. Macaroni salad. Meatballs.\nMarinated sardines. Broccoli.%K%P
菠菜摊鸡蛋、意大利红肠、沙拉通心粉、肉丸子、\n腌沙丁鱼、西兰花。%K%P
...And a croquette.%K%P
…另外还有，可乐饼。%K%P
In terms of looks, size, and nutritional balance, it was\nperfect. She really did an amazing job with this lunch\nbox, especially considering it was for someone like me.%K%P
无论成色、膳食营养平衡，还是量都无可辩驳，\n真的是很用心的便当。%K%P
