A residential area almost completely isolated from the\nclamor of the city.%K%P
车站前的嘈杂追不上我慌慌张张的奔跑，\n在我身后消失得无影无踪，然后只剩下幽静的住宅街。%K%P
I spotted a sign with the name of my location on it --\nEast Hagimori 3rd District. All I had to do was continue\nstraight down this road.%K%P
