%LC美都子
\dFriendship and money don't mix.\d%K%P
「金钱可是会破坏友情的哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMoney lent to a friend is as good as gone. ...It wouldn't\nbe the first for me.\d%K%P
「如果是借给朋友的话，就当是把钱扔了吧。\n…我是有自信这样去实践的哦？」%K%P
After all, she had just pulled a huge prank on me.%K%P
她对我，做了如此坏心眼的事。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm... not sure if I could do the same if you were behind\nwith rent.\d%K%P
「我…\n可是没有欠了房钱就给你撵走的自信啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're sure you can't let me in? Did someone already move\nin while I was gone?\d%K%P
「无论如何都不行吗？\n是已经满房了吗？」%K%P
After all, she wanted to get a reaction from me.%K%P
因为她，在期待着我的反应。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha... Ahahahaha.\d%K%P
「…啊哈哈…啊哈哈哈哈」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhahaha...\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…」%K%P
She expected anger from me -- she trusted I would make a\nmove.%K%P
因为她『一直都期待着』我会生气…\n然后行动起来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMr. Laid-off... you're such a dummy.\d%K%P
「哈啊，失业先生…你啊，真是个笨蛋」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's exactly why I got laid off.\d%K%P
「所以才会失业的啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Touche.\d%K%P
「…确实」%K%P
And so, as stubborn as she was, she decided to give me a\nchance.%K%P
所以，顽固的她，\n才会轻松地改变那个态度。%K%P
This had to be one of the few times I'd actually managed\nto make the correct choice.%K%P
我觉得只限于这次，\n自己心中的答案是正确的。%K%P
I wondered if it was all just wishful thinking on my\npart...%K%P
不管我错过了多少次，都耐心等着我的这个女孩，\n果然是那个人的女儿，这种正确的想法…%K%P
...expecting this girl, who had waited for me despite all\nmy mistakes and hiccups, to be like her mother.%K%P
是我的爱屋及乌，还是说…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI guess we should call everyone and have a party in Room\n#4, then! I'm totally up for some Mar** Ca**!\d%K%P
「那，快点把各位都叫到四号房开欢迎会吧？\n马里○赛○车！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...So you really do play that.\d%K%P
「…真的要搞啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't have the game myself, but they let me play\nsometimes.\d%K%P
「虽然说我没有那个游戏，还得向大家借就是了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSame as me. Guess we've got something in common, huh?\d%K%P
「我也是。真是巧啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShall we go, then?\d%K%P
「来，快走吧？」%K%P
Goodbye, my second love.%K%P
再见了，我的第二次恋爱。%K%P
Goodbye, my three months' worth of hard labor.%K%P
再见了，我三个月的肉体劳动成果。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI look forward to living here. Thank you, Ms. Landlo...\nMitoko.\d%K%P
「从今往后请多关照。\n房东小…美都子小………美都子」%K%P
And so, after an entire year of emptiness, I once again\ngained a goal in my life...%K%P
然后，我崭新的生活，\n和我那已经阔别一年的人生目标一道，开启了新的篇章。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDon't mention it! ...Mr. Laid-off!\d%K%P
「嗯！…失业先生」%K%P
...hoping this would lead me to finding a new job. And\nsoon.%K%P
………同时在心中暗暗发誓，一定要早日再找到工作。%K%P
